{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Step into the sandals of a Spartan scout.</strong> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As you traverse across the Viking, Roman, Egyptian, and Chinese empires, you'll face brutal enemies, fierce bosses, and uncover important war tactics hidden in ancient scrolls.\u00a0</i>Along the way, you\u2019ll witness tragic events and find legendary mythic weapons<i>. Use your expert combat skills, spear, shield, and bow to claim victory in every mission, as you bring Sparta closer to its world domination. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Can you</strong> <strong>rise to the challenge and lead Sparta to greatness?</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Action-Packed Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on powerful enemies in a Dark Souls III-inspired combat system with finishers, backstabs, and brutal executions.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721520/extras/2d9a27712e004b929e3c658e61a5dab0.poster.avif?t=1768303742\" aria-label=\"Gif\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721520/extras/2d9a27712e004b929e3c658e61a5dab0.webm?t=1768303742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721520/extras/2d9a27712e004b929e3c658e61a5dab0.mp4?t=1768303742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Parkour Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap, climb, and vault through ancient cities and rugged terrains.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721520/extras/534d817dbb0e000380574a50f8503157.poster.avif?t=1768303742\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721520/extras/534d817dbb0e000380574a50f8503157.webm?t=1768303742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721520/extras/534d817dbb0e000380574a50f8503157.mp4?t=1768303742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Tactical Quests</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face kings and army generals and retrieve war tactics to shape Sparta\u2019s future.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721520/extras/7195cc29c5582fb713a64322c6a1e10b.poster.avif?t=1768303742\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721520/extras/7195cc29c5582fb713a64322c6a1e10b.webm?t=1768303742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721520/extras/7195cc29c5582fb713a64322c6a1e10b.mp4?t=1768303742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Immersive Empire Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore distinct levels, each inspired by a different ancient empire, featuring authentic architecture and combat style.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721520/extras/099a0a05e5577d9d2940bac6eecbd582.poster.avif?t=1768303742\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721520/extras/099a0a05e5577d9d2940bac6eecbd582.webm?t=1768303742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721520/extras/099a0a05e5577d9d2940bac6eecbd582.mp4?t=1768303742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span